'''Mini White Cyclone''' (ミニホワイトサイクロン, ''Mini Howaito Saikuron'', '''Mini White Cyclone''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]] and variant of [[White Cyclone]] that appears in [[Zero Legends]]. He was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Mini White Cyclone
|image = E 638.png
|first appearance = '''ZL''': [[Neutrino Snowlands|Sub-chapter 2 - Neutrino Snowlands]]
|money drop = 1,111¢ - 4,388¢
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Tender Trap|Sub-chapter 17 - Tender Trap]]
}}

==Enemy==
A mix between [[Mesocosmocyclone]] and [[Li'l Zyclone]], Mini White Cyclone has high health, slightly improved range, only one knockback and most importantly boasts enough DPS to tear any unit apart in a matter of seconds, despite being only single target. However, he isn't that much of a threat on his own due to being even slower than the original and his relatively low range on top of his single attack.

==Strategy==
Since this enemy still has very low range and speed, he remains vulnerable to [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] and [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. He only becomes somewhat of an issue when backed by other enemies, such as [[Hannya]] and [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s in [[Neutrino Snowlands]].

